            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लुटाना — luṭānā — \"to squander; to give away freely\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उसने अपने पैसे जुए में लुटा दिए। Usne apne paise jue meṁ luṭā diye. He squandered his money on gambling."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने पैसे लुटाए, usne paise luṭāe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लुटाना (luṭānā) is the causative of lūṭnā, \"to plunder\", which CDIAL derives from luṭṭati, a reconstructed form (CDIAL 11078): to let one's goods be carried off."
            }
          ]
        },
